# Build context scoping for deploy/Dockerfile.
#
# The image only needs: go.mod / go.work / go.work.sum, the three
# workspace sub-module manifests, cmd/, and internal/. Everything
# else is either irrelevant (docs, examples, tests/, .git/) or
# actively hostile to image hygiene (secrets in .env files, local
# planning notes, editor state). Excluding them cuts the build
# context from hundreds of MB to a handful and keeps stray secrets
# from ever touching the Docker daemon, even transiently.
#
# Keep this in step with .gitignore; the two files have overlapping
# but distinct goals (gitignore = history; dockerignore = build
# context). When in doubt, prefer exclusion — if a Dockerfile COPY
# later needs a path that lives here, add a negation rather than
# loosening the rules globally.

# VCS metadata — never needed inside the image, large on busy repos.
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# Build outputs and local binaries.
/clockify-mcp
bin/
dist/
staging/
coverage.out
coverage/
.bench/

# Editor / tool / OS clutter.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Environment files — defence in depth. The Dockerfile never COPYs
# them, but a stray .env in the build context can still leak via
# inadvertent `COPY . .` regressions in operator-customised images.
.env
.env.*
deploy/.env
deploy/.env.*
examples/*.env

# Planning, agent, and local assistant state. Never part of a build.
.planning/
.claude/
.claude-campaign/
.claude-campaign-worktrees/
.agent-campaign/
.agent-campaign-worktrees/
.serena/
.remember/

# QA-swarm session infra (gitignored already; mirror here so a fresh
# clone with leftover worktrees still produces a small context).
qa-agents.tsv
qa-findings/
qa-logs/
qa-prompts/
qa-worktrees/
run-all-agents.sh
run-one-agent.sh
summarize-findings.sh
normal-user-master-prompt.txt
scripts/qa-swarm/

# Docs and examples — useful in the repo, not needed by the runtime
# binary. The OCI image labels reference these via URLs, not file
# bundling.
docs/
examples/
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
SECURITY.md
AGENTS.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE

# Test data and harness assets that never enter the binary.
tests/
*.test
*.out
*.prof
